# Parallelization
Partition :	6 1 1
I/O partition : 1 1 1

# Mesh definition
X ligament : 2
Lx : 4!3.75!20  
Ly : 3!1.875!10  
Lz : 3!1.875!10  
nx : 96!128!256!512
ny : 72!48!64!128!256
nz : 72!48!64!128!256

# Flow conditions
Reynolds number :      1778!100
Weber number :         13.8!20 !15
Viscosity ratio :      66.7!50
Density ratio :        657.5!1000
Target Re_lambda :     45
Turbulence intensity : 0.019!0.05

# Break-up model
Transfer drops : .true.
Transfer films : .true.
Transfer ligaments : .true.

# SGS model
Use SGS model : .true.
# Time integration
Max timestep size : 1.2e-2
Max cfl number :    0.8
Max time :          17

# EXPLICIT WENO
Use WENO: .true.
# Pressure solver
Pressure tolerance : 1e-5
Pressure iteration : 100

# Ensight output
Ensight output period : 0.25
Restart output period : 30

# Data restart
Restart from :
